    "ParentObjectID": "water_sawmill_iron_rivet",
    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_IronRivet_CardDescription",
    "DefaultText": "A Cast Iron Rivet from before Water-Driven Infrastructure switched to the shared Metal Nail of CSFFModFramework. Within a quarter of an hour it becomes an Iron Nail (a Metal Nail of iron, Metal Type 200) by itself; Reforge as Metal Nail does it at once. Nothing makes this card any more."
  },
  "CardHelpSection": {
    "ParentObjectID": "water_sawmill_iron_rivet",
    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_IronRivet_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Retired:</b> Water-Driven Infrastructure no longer makes its own Cast Iron Rivet. Every WDI recipe now takes the shared Metal Nail, the one CSFFModFramework ships for all mods. This old card turns into an Iron Nail (a Metal Nail of iron, Metal Type 200) by itself within a quarter of an hour, or at once with Reforge as Metal Nail."
  },
